[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0375","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0375.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0192","title":"RedHat Linux telnetd TERMCAP 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Telnet 守护进程中的 tgetent() 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 TERMCAP 环境变量，触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 RedHat Linux 6.0 及 Slackware Linux 4.0 等版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0192"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:51Z","remediation":"立即禁用 telnet 服务：编辑 /etc/inetd.conf 注释 telnet 行后重启 inetd（或执行 service telnet stop），升级到不再提供 telnetd 的现代发行版；迁移至 SSH（OpenSSH）替代远程管理。如必须保留 telnet，可安装 TCP Wrapper 配置 hosts.allow/hosts.deny 限制源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0192","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19465","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0192.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1421f0a4349d5d46275cadd9c7c62349edf9c8bb/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0192.json","https://github.com/x0rz/EQGRP/blob/0c2354ff1073099b2aa417030b3167ec29d7279c/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0192","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0192.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db45dbc75ff0264d63b603291e4a83d7361bd7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0192.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0192.md","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0192.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0375.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0567","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0567.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0346","title":"PHP PHP/FI mlog 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"CVE-1999-0346 是 PHP 的 mlog CGI 脚本中存在的一个任意文件读取漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标服务器上该脚本发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用参数注入的方式读取服务器上的任意敏感文件（如 /etc/passwd、配置文件等），导致信息泄露。该漏洞影响早期 PHP 版本，攻击条件低（无需认证、远程利用）。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0346"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-10-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:11Z","remediation":"升级至 PHP 3.0.17 或更高版本（已修复该 CGI 漏洞），或删除/禁用服务器上的 mlog CGI 脚本。若无法升级，请在 Web 服务器配置中禁止执行 /cgi-bin/php/fi/mlog 等路径，并设置文件系统权限限制 CGI 进程仅访问必要目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/3397","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/713","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/77be9686a381151781bc75b69de578b4d9528aae/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0346.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0346","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0346.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ed191c1149de50e461e9a357f4a3a22e603f0d1/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0346.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b7a93df7f7051799495805bc211adea8d202dae7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9fhg-rgm9-gqph/GHSA-9fhg-rgm9-gqph.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-misc.rules","https://github.com/mtesauro/owasp-wte/blob/e4c016caf67d59634f309f2a1feeed7dc9515abe/temp-projects/spikeproxy/contents/opt/owasp/spikeproxy/scan_database.db","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/P/php_arbitrary_file_access.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/763b4dfa75aa1890a155aad1b583fdcab8111c49/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0346.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0567.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1413","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1413.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1224","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":128,\"inputTokens\":10678,\"outputTokens\":16,\"totalTokens\":10822}}","description":"CVE-1999-1224 是 IMAP 服务（如 IMAP 4.1 BETA 及可能其他版本）中存在的一个拒绝服务漏洞。其原理是 imapd 进程未能正确处理 SIGABRT（abort）信号，当本地用户向服务器发送特定顺序的命令组合时，会触发中止信号导致服务进程异常崩溃并生成核心转储（core dump）文件。该漏洞影响运行上述存在缺陷版本 IMAP 服务的系统。攻击条件为攻击者需具备目标系统的本地访问权限。利用方式是本地用户通过构造并发送特定命令序列诱发服务崩溃，不仅造成邮件服务不可用，而且生成的核心转储文件中可能包含敏感密码等凭据信息，存在信息泄露风险。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1224"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-10-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:59Z","remediation":"升级到 IMAP 4.1 正式发布版（4.1 final 或更高版本），该版本已修复对 SIGABRT 信号处理不当的问题。若无法立即升级，可在服务端以非特权用户运行 imapd，并配置系统限制 core dump 文件生成（如执行 ulimit -c 0 或在 /etc/security/limits.conf 中设置 * hard core 0），同时收紧 imapd 运行目录权限，防止 core 文件泄露敏感口令信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87635124302928&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/349","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1224.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dde4d96d7c1eff197b9a15817af615500736afa7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1224.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1224","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1224.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1224.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xgvp-66r9-6jg6/GHSA-xgvp-66r9-6jg6.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x85000/84478/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1224.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000223.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1413.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1315","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1315.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1062","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9125,\"outputTokens\":14,\"totalTokens\":10803}}","description":"HP LaserJet 打印机 JetDirect 卡配置 TCP/IP 协议时存在安全绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可直接向目标打印机的 TCP 9099 和 9100 端口发送 PostScript 文档，绕过打印过滤器执行任意打印操作或获取敏感信息。该漏洞影响配置了 JetDirect 卡的 HP LaserJet 系列打印机，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1062"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:37Z","remediation":"建议升级 HP JetDirect 固件至最新版本（建议升级至 J.60.09 或更高版本），或在打印机管理界面禁用 TCP 端口 9099 和 9100 的原始打印功能。若无法升级固件，建议在网络防火墙或打印机访问控制列表中阻断外部访问 TCP 9099 和 9100 端口，仅允许受信任打印服务器 IP 访问。同时建议启用打印机的访问控制列表（ACL）功能，限制仅授权 IP 地址可提交打印任务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602248518480&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1876","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60a5b982d99d7dad1ea61174940fb/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1062.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1062","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1062.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bc48b6c04c59ceff2d71da45cd843fc1d449dc48/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1062.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vcj4-948w-5pwr/GHSA-vcj4-948w-5pwr.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/h/hp_remote_print.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1062.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87936/info.html","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_bypass.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1315.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1313","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1313.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1061","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":10799,\"outputTokens\":23,\"totalTokens\":10822}}","description":"HP Laserjet打印机配备JetDirect卡并配置TCP/IP时，默认未设置密码保护，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可直接连接打印机并篡改其IP地址或禁用日志记录功能。该漏洞影响所有使用JetDirect卡启用TCP/IP网络打印的HP Laserjet系列打印机设备。攻击者无需任何凭据即可通过Telnet或JetDirect服务连接目标打印机，修改网络配置导致打印服务中断或路由至恶意地址，同时关闭日志功能使安全审计失效。CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。建议为JetDirect TCP/IP配置启用密码认证并限制访问来源。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1061"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:37Z","remediation":"为 HP JetDirect 卡启用并设置强管理员密码（通过打印机控制面板、JetDirect 嵌入式 Web 或 telnet 管理界面），禁止无密码 TCP/IP 配置；在边界防火墙/ACL 上限制仅管理网段可访问打印机 23/515/9099/9100 端口，并将设备划入隔离 VLAN，禁止公网及非必要网段直连；无法立即加固时，临时关闭远程管理并仅允许可信主机通过打印服务器转发任务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602248518480&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1876","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/431324351d69005e5e9ea9d116dc965ce92ed482/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1061.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1061","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1061.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bc48b6c04c59ceff2d71da45cd843fc1d449dc48/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1061.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4m74-673g-77xx/GHSA-4m74-673g-77xx.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/passwordless_lexmark_printer.nasl","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2012/gb_hp_jet_direct_unauthenticated_access.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1061.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87933/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1313.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0160","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0160.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0061","title":"BSD Line Printer Daemon (lpd) 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"BSD 行式打印机守护进程（lpd）存在远程代码执行漏洞，源于其对打印任务处理过程中缺乏充分的访问控制与输入验证。远程攻击者无需认证即可向运行 lpd 服务的目标系统发送特制的打印请求，实现任意文件创建、删除或远程命令执行。该漏洞影响 Linux 及 BSD 系列操作系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0061"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-10-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:29Z","remediation":"禁用 lpd 服务（`killall lpd` 并移除启动项），升级到已修复版本，或使用 TCP Wrapper 限制端口 515 仅允许受信主机访问；对于不需要网络打印的系统，建议直接卸载 lpd 替代为 CUPS 或 LPRng 等现代打印系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0061"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0160.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1402","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1402.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1213","title":"HP HP-UX 10.30 Telnet Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP-UX 10.30 的 Telnet 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统的 Telnet 端口（默认 23）发送特制数据包，导致 telnetd 进程崩溃或资源耗尽，从而使服务不可用。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 10.30 版本，攻击条件简单，危害等级中等，建议升级至修复版本或限制 Telnet 服务访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1213"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:57Z","remediation":"立即禁用 telnet 服务：编辑 /etc/inetd.conf，注释或删除 telnet 行后执行 inetd -c 重载配置；或直接停止 telnet 服务进程。将远程管理迁移至 SSH 协议。升级 HP-UX 至 11i v3 或更高版本，并安装 HP 对应 PHCO 补丁。在边界防火墙上阻断 TCP 23 端口外来访问，缩小攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www2.dataguard.no/bugtraq/1997_4/0001.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/571","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1213.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1213.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1213","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1213.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1213.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/a913ac9f87691de86825ecccd6699d1970d6fddc/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-12xx/CVE-1999-1213.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a007c8fe94b232452ea95ec8ec071fdd18c286f/1999/CVE-1999-1213.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1213.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1213.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/27bda0043c24e3a60635efaebd455bc46f911f61/api/1999/CVE-1999-1213.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1402.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0541","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0541.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0326","title":"HP HP-UX mediainit 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"HP-UX 操作系统中的 mediainit 媒体设备初始化程序存在安全漏洞。该程序用于初始化磁带机等存储设备，但由于对输入参数缺乏充分验证，本地攻击者可利用该缺陷，通过向 mediainit 程序传递特制参数触发漏洞，导致系统机密信息部分泄露、系统数据被部分篡改或服务部分不可用。此漏洞为本地利用，无需额外认证，攻击复杂度低，影响 HP-UX 系统多个版本，CVSS v2 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。HP 已通过安全公告 HPSBUX9710-071 提供修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0326"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:09Z","remediation":"立即应用 HP 安全公告 HPSBUX9710-071 提供的官方补丁。如无法打补丁，可移除 mediainit 程序的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/mediainit），并限制可执行权限仅授予信任的管理员用户组。建议将 HP-UX 系统升级至包含该修复的后续版本（如 11.0 以上），因 10.x 系列已终止技术支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9710-071"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0541.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0497","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0497.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0300","title":"Sun Solaris NIS+ nis_cachemgr 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Solaris NIS+ 的 nis_cachemgr 缓存管理器存在安全设计缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用该漏洞向缓存中注入恶意的 NIS+ 服务器信息。当客户端查询网络信息服务时，将连接到攻击者控制的伪造服务器，导致敏感信息（如用户凭据、主机配置）被窃取或服务遭到劫持。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.3/2.4/2.5/2.5.1 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0300"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:06Z","remediation":"针对 Solaris NIS+ 的 nis_cachemgr 漏洞，建议立即安装 Sun Security Bulletin #155 中提供的官方补丁。如运行 Solaris 2.3/2.4/2.5/2.5.1 且无法打补丁，应在网络边界通过防火墙限制对 nis_cachemgr 端口（TCP/UDP 387）的访问，仅允许受信 NIS+ 服务器通信。由于 NIS+ 已停止维护，建议迁移至基于 LDAP 的命名服务以获得长期安全支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/155","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/92d64b4c9b3c5a0ce1fd1e5f8c017b9772e0139b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0300.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0300","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0300.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0300.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db45dbc75ff0264d63b603291e4a83d7361bd7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0300.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0300.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154400_154500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--12792e2d-cd40-4418-b42c-679d4e4e14e3.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0497.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0458","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0458.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0272","title":"Slmail POP3 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Slmail 3.0.2421 及 2.5 版本的 POP3 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标主机的 POP3 端口（默认 110）发送特制恶意数据包，导致服务进程崩溃或停止响应，造成正常的邮件收发功能中断。该漏洞利用方式简单，无需复杂权限即可触发，影响运行 Slmail 服务的邮件服务器系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0272"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:02Z","remediation":"Slmail 产品已停止维护多年，建议迁移至现代受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 Postfix、Exchange 等）。如仍需继续使用，可在防火墙层面限制 POP3 端口（110）仅允许受信任 IP 段访问，并监控异常连接流量作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0272","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab669d9fb37e52ed0619cb2b8265d34528fbe875/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0272.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0272.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0272.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0272","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0272.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b69cf2313f68e29acceed58f52f6109cd37bb04/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-02xx/CVE-1999-0272.json","https://github.com/justakazh/CVE_Database/blob/06bd07f32c89b43f30d59ff450dfbb661e471cbe/1999/CVE-1999-0272.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2d2ea2d13a3a7facfa195486d4f9782c62a06518/1999/CVE-1999-0272.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0272.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/e75163879b5629a697822216993d714626893061/api/1999/CVE-1999-0272.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0458.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0213","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0213.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0090","title":"IBM AIX rcp 命令本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"AIX 系统 rcp 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 rcp 命令提交超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖内存数据并获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。利用需要本地用户身份，成功利用后攻击者可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0090"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:33Z","remediation":"IBM 已在 AIX 4.x 版本的 APAR IY09308 中修复此漏洞，建议更新 bos.rte.net_filesystem fileset 至包含该 APAR 的维护级别。临时缓解措施可移除 /usr/bin/rcp 的 setuid 权限：chmod u-s /usr/bin/rcp，或禁用 r-commands 服务（rshd、rexecd）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0090"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0213.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0490","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0490.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0295","title":"Sun Solaris sysdef 命令本地内核内存信息泄露漏洞","description":"Solaris 操作系统中的 sysdef 命令存在内核内存信息泄露漏洞。本地普通用户可通过执行 sysdef 命令读取内核内存中的敏感数据，进而获取内核地址布局等关键信息，结合其他漏洞可导致权限提升至 root 级别。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.4/2.5/2.5.1 及 SunOS 5.3-5.5.1 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。Sun 已发布安全公告 157 提供修复方案。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0295"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-10-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"1997-10-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 Sun Security Bulletin 157 提供的官方补丁。鉴于 SunOS 5.3~5.5.1 及 Solaris 2.4~2.5.1 均已停止维护，建议升级到受支持的 Oracle Solaris 11.4 或更高版本。如无法升级，临时缓解措施为：以 root 权限执行 chmod 700 /usr/sbin/sysdef 限制 sysdef 命令的访问权限，仅允许 root 用户执行，同时移除 sysdef 的 SUID 位（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/sysdef），防止本地普通用户通过该命令读取内核内存。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0490.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0368","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0368.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0185","title":"Sun SunOS/Solaris FTP 服务数据端口信任滥用远程命令执行漏洞","description":"SunOS/Solaris 系统中 FTP 服务与 rlogin 服务之间存在信任关系绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可利用 FTP 协议的数据端口（20/tcp）主动连接至目标主机上受信任的 rlogin 服务，绕过正常认证机制实现远程命令执行。该漏洞源于 FTP 服务器被目标主机配置为信任主机，攻击者无需任何凭证即可通过构造特殊 FTP 会话获得对目标系统的完全控制，影响 SunOS 5.3~5.5.1 及 Solaris 2.3~2.5.1 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0185"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-10-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"1997-10-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Sun Security Bulletin #156 提供的对应 Solaris 版本补丁。停止使用 rlogin/rsh 服务，改用 SSH 进行远程管理；删除 /etc/hosts.equiv 及所有用户的 .rhosts 文件以消除主机间隐式信任关系；配置 FTP 服务禁止 PORT 命令反弹连接至非 FTP 端口（如在 wu-ftpd 中设置 refuse-connection 规则），阻断反弹攻击路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0368.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0329","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0329.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0160","title":"Cisco IOS PPP CHAP 认证绕过漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 设备的 PPP CHAP 认证机制存在安全绕过漏洞。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可利用该漏洞建立未授权的 PPP 连接，从而获得目标网络的访问权限，可能导致敏感信息泄露、数据篡改或服务中断。该漏洞影响多款经典 Cisco IOS 设备，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，CVSS v2 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0160"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-10-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"1997-10-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 11.1 或更高版本（该漏洞已在 11.1 及后续维护版本中修复）。如无法立即升级，可在 PPP 接口配置 `access-class` ACL 限制仅允许可信源 IP 建立拨号连接，并在全局配置下使用 `no service tcp-small-servers` 和 `no service udp-small-servers` 关闭不必要的小型服务以减小攻击面。对于仍在运行不受支持老版本 IOS 的设备，建议迁移至当前受支持的 IOS 版本或替换为现代网络设备。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0329.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0300","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0300","title":"Sun Solaris NIS+ 缓存管理器允许添加恶意 NIS+ 服务器","description":"Solaris 系统中的 NIS+ 缓存管理器（nis_cachemgr）存在安全漏洞，远程未经认证的攻击者可以利用该漏洞向受信任的 NIS+ 服务器列表中添加恶意 NIS+ 服务器。成功利用后，攻击者可以提供伪造的 NIS+ 数据，导致系统配置被篡改、认证绕过或权限提升。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.3、2.4、2.5、2.5.1 等多个版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0300"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-10-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-11-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议升级到 Solaris 7 及以上版本，或安装 Sun 安全公告 #155 提供的补丁。同时限制对 NIS+ 服务的网络访问，在防火墙层面过滤不可信来源的请求，禁用不必要的 NIS+ 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2024-06-01T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/155"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0300.toml"}]